From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:18:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: j71t: enable paired sleep and the s2idle
 gadget

Mark the J71t ANS port for paired system sleep and keep the USB gadget
connected over suspend to idle.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts
index 3ee634e79..d03bc4ff6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003-j71t.dts
@@ -75,3 +75,11 @@
 &wdt {
 	apple,tethered-boot;
 };
+
+&pcie0 {
+	apple,paired-system-sleep;
+};
+
+&usbdev {
+	apple,retain-gadget-in-s2idle;
+};
